cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper below, which describes the
  method, and name this fork (Kinderspital Zürich) and its version or
  commit, which is what you ran.
title: "nct2ctml (Kinderspital Zürich fork): paediatric oncology trial matching"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/lgrob/nct2ctml
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Pulls paediatric oncology trials from ClinicalTrials.gov and EU CTIS, maps
  their eligibility criteria to CTML with deterministic rules and an LLM,
  routes the result through human review, and publishes a flat index for
  joining against genomic samples. A fork of sumedhasaxena/nct2ctml,
  retargeted from adult oncology in Hong Kong.
keywords:
  - clinical trial matching
  - paediatric oncology
  - CTML
  - MatchMiner
  - large language models
authors:
